    "Upgrade bundled SQLite and qualify all seven direct consumers.",
    "Distinguish live read pins in health reporting; measure many-pin scanning, connection/FD admission and post-close physical reclamation.",
    "Coherent startup and all-mode Git/Capsule generation ownership; remote GC retention for old readers.",
    "Dirty mapped refresh/switch, reset and all foreground/helper/coordinator/daemon owners.",
    "Mixed recipes, crash/restart recovery and owned-cache namespace migration.",
    "Complete Crab pack-v1 authority removal, including SDK initialization, protected receive, maintenance, LFS and S3 owners.",
    "Total memory/reply/COW/prefetch admission, native Git fetch deadlines and NFS child drain.",
    "Bounded FUSE dispatch and same-inode concurrency, cold ordinary blob fills, directories and effective prefetch.",
    "Optimized cold/warm throughput, origin amplification, p95/p99, RSS/CPU/teardown, default split-helper packaging and native macOS NFS.",
    "Full CLI/helper suite; pending checkpoint-format test exception is unapplied."
  ],
